  "notes": "Two soundtracks composed by Fabio Frizzi and Giorgio Cascio for two Italian horror films directed by [a=Lucio Fulci].\nTracks 1 to 8 from Zombi 2 (aka Zombie), made in 1979.  Original publisher: Varflo Dist., Licensed by Fabio Frizzi & Giorgio Cascio\nTracks 9 to 23 from Un Gatto Nel Cervello (aka Cat In The Brain), made in 1990.  Original publisher: Ribot, Licensed by Fabio Frizzi.\n(p) 1998\nTotal time: 55:57\nSpecial thanks to Roger Konrad, for his precious “Stubbornness”  (printed as 'Stubborness')\nJewel case with six-page leaflet.  Durations listed on leaflet.",
